# Allowlist: only what the playground build reads. Keeps source/, docs and
# .git out of the context, so doc-only edits don't invalidate the image.
*
!tokens/
!assets/
!examples/
!playground/

playground/node_modules
playground/dist
playground/src/variants/*/generated
# licensed fonts (Sharp Sans) would be bundled into dist/ and served publicly
playground/fonts-local/*
!playground/fonts-local/README.md
**/.DS_Store
